'''Pokémon: Happy Birthday to You!''' is a one-minute music video that was available to watch on [[Netflix]] from September 14, 2017 to September 13, 2021. It features the {{aniseries|PTS}} cast singing a rendition of ''{{wp|Happy Birthday to You}}'', accompanied by clips from ''[[Pokémon the Series: XY]]'' and two clips from ''[[Pokémon the Series: Black & White]]''.

It was released as part of [https://www.netflix.com/search?q=birthday%20songs Birthdays On-Demand], which included 14 other videos featuring characters from ''{{wp|All Hail King Julien}}'', ''{{wp|Barbie}}'', ''{{wp|Beat Bugs}}'', ''{{wp|Dinotrux}}'', ''{{wp|Legend Quest (2017 TV series)|Legend Quest}}'', ''{{wp|Lego Friends|LEGO: Friends}}'', ''{{wp|Ninjago (TV series)|LEGO Ninjago}}'', ''{{wp|Luna Petunia}}'', ''{{wp|Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug & Cat Noir|Miraculous}}'', ''{{wp|My Little Pony: Friendship Is Magic|My Little Pony}}'', ''{{wp|Project Mc2|Project Mc²}}'', ''{{wp|Skylanders Academy}}'', ''{{wp|Trollhunters: Tales of Arcadia|Trollhunters}}'', and ''{{wp|Word Party}}''. It was released outside of Asia with English, German, French, Italian, European Spanish, Latin American Spanish, Czech, Danish, Greek, Finnish, Hebrew, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Brazilian Portuguese, European Portuguese, Russian, Swedish, and Turkish audio and subtitles.

